WEBVTT

00:27:58.030 --> 00:28:01.196
So it's gotta be harder, though,
to do your job in some ways,

00:28:01.220 --> 00:28:03.011
because you can't touch the person

00:28:03.035 --> 00:28:06.896
or even control the
scissors or the clippers.

00:28:06.920 --> 00:28:09.616
JA: Well, that's where
the education comes in.

00:28:09.640 --> 00:28:12.110
It's truly amazing to see
what people can do

00:28:12.134 --> 00:28:17.067
from a video chat call
and their home tools.

00:28:17.091 --> 00:28:18.618
That line is kind of shattered.

00:28:18.642 --> 00:28:21.986
Coco: OK, I think
I am shattering that line.

00:28:22.010 --> 00:28:23.473
It's still, like, a little --

00:28:23.497 --> 00:28:26.286
JA: Shattering like broken glass!

00:28:26.310 --> 00:28:28.546
AG: JaBarie's enthusiasm
for this new platform

00:28:28.570 --> 00:28:31.916
has helped him maintain his livelihood
during the pandemic.